AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0020017> "An identifier that is typically a part of a person's name which has been passed, according to law or custom, from one or both parents to their children."@en)
